      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this brightness map should be dropped. After doing some more experimentation and digging, I found that without auto-brightness, this is a no-op on this top panel. On the bottom panel, this map is the only way to avoid the follower spline generated in com.android.server.display.DisplayDeviceConfig from reaching 0 brightness and turning the bottom panel off\n\n- The last \u003cvalue\u003e must stay 1.0, or the display config fails to load and system_server bootloops.\n- The \u003cnits\u003e numbers are unused (no sensor), so only the two \u003cvalue\u003e endpoints matter",
      "revId": "a4d723f39ce2d1b909107b74ee6837096921428b",
      "serverId": "1ec6b3db-b2c1-4fa4-84a2-4c7efe89ba71"
